            <div xml:id="d474">

                <pb facs="0701" n="599" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg599"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/173: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >George</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-02-25T12:00:00+02:35">February 25,
                            1935—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 12:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. My telegram No. 19.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d474-f1"/> Emperor informs me direct
                    negotiations hopeless. Will renew appeal to Geneva.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
